gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Elasticsearch Version\n\n8.15\n\n### Installed Plugins\n\n_No response_\n\n### Java Version\n\n_bundled_\n\n### OS Version\n\nx\n\n### Problem Description\n\nSynthetic source is not consistent when handling objects with `dynamic: false`. This inconsistency also results in reduced storage efficiency.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n```\r\n\r\nPUT /my_index\r\n{\r\n  \"mappings\": {\r\n    \"_source\": { \"mode\": \"synthetic\" },\r\n    \"properties\": {\r\n      \"obj\": {\r\n        \"dynamic\": false,\r\n        \"properties\": {\r\n          \"n\": {\r\n           \"type\": \"long\"\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nPUT my_index/_doc/1\r\n{\r\n  \"obj\": \r\n    {\r\n      \"n\": [3, 2, 1],\r\n      \"k\": [\"hello\", \"a\"]\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nPUT my_index/_doc/2\r\n{\r\n  \"obj\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"n\": [3, 2, 1],\r\n      \"k\": \"hello\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"n\": [6, 5, 4],\r\n      \"k\": \"hello2\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nGET /my_index/_doc/1\r\n\r\n# \"n\" is constructed from doc values and is sorted, \"k\" is stored as is (expected)\r\n\"_source\": {\r\n    \"obj\": {\r\n        \"k\": [\r\n            \"hello\",\r\n            \"a\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"n\": [\r\n            1,\r\n            2,\r\n            3\r\n        ]\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nGET /my_index/_doc/2\r\n\r\n# entire object array is stored as is, fields are not sorted and arrays are not moved to leaf fields (unexpected)\r\n\"_source\": {\r\n    \"obj\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"n\": [\r\n                3,\r\n                2,\r\n                1\r\n            ],\r\n            \"k\": \"hello\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"n\": [\r\n                6,\r\n                5,\r\n                4\r\n            ],\r\n            \"k\": \"hello2\"\r\n        }\r\n    ]\r\n}\r\n```\n\n### Logs (if relevant)\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"kkrik-es","id":131142368,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9ES4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131142368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es","html_url":"https://github.com/kkrik-es","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kkrik-es/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111916/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}